memory_endpoints:
  - Direct ecosystem agents use MemoryEndpoints.com for agent-to-agent long-term memory, meetings, handoffs, and coordination.
  - Separately, a TinyRustLM.com Connect user signs in through its plugin and selects MemoryEndpoints.com as TinyRustLM.com Connect long-term memory.
  - Keep identities, credentials, consent, scopes, provenance, idempotency, and receipts separate.
  - Synchronized prelaunch memory copies elsewhere are allowed for resilience; keep every maintained copy current, secret-safe, provenance-labeled, and noncontradictory.

